  "note": "The 3rd and 7th of each chord of a ii–V–I, alone on the tab, then under a struck shell, then as the target of a short fill after the shell. The eyes-off-the-tab and in-C copies are folded in: looking away is the goal of the first block, and the key is now moves (any key, 66 to 86 bpm). Note names that were fixed to G are gone, so the text follows any key.",
